{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 322, "timestamp": "2026-10-15T10:08:16.958Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad0a60d40fc81919b50409fac98fb9d", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["Iâ€™ll build this in stages on top of MarketLink: live charts and data export, a testable SMC strategy engine, repeated backtests with stop/resume controls, and deployment of a selected strategy. Iâ€™ll use PF above 2 as a search target, but â€œstrategy readyâ€ will also require separate validation; a good result from repeated tests on the same five days would not be enough.\n\nIâ€™ll first inspect the current app, MT5 setup, available Exness symbols, and your PCâ€™s capacity, then start implementing. Iâ€™ll keep live-data retention at five days and use separate temporary datasets for longer backtests.\n\n"], "text": "Iâ€™ll build this in stages on top of MarketLink: live charts and data export, a testable SMC strategy engine, repeated backtests with stop/resume controls, and deployment of a selected strategy. Iâ€™ll use PF above 2 as a search target, but â€œstrategy readyâ€ will also require separate validation; a good result from repeated tests on the same five days would not be enough.\n\nIâ€™ll first inspect the current app, MT5 setup, available Exness symbols, and your PCâ€™s capacity, then start implementing. Iâ€™ll keep live-data retention at five days and use separate temporary datasets for longer backtests.\n\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 74, "text_sha256": "52865b2cfcf9f53f836e2650fa5242f5094e2c7674d6f320651116ea34bfcf2b", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 417, "timestamp": "2026-10-15T10:14:50.945Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad0a798be308191956b83d98d3d5de4", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["Iâ€™ve split the build into three parallel parts: the SMC engine, a read-only MT5 data service, and the new chart/research interface. The engine will record when each signal became knowable, so a historical chart cannot silently use future candles to produce better-looking results.\n\nYour PC has 16 GB of RAM, so Iâ€™m also adding limits and cancellation to keep larger tick downloads and repeated tests manageable."], "text": "Iâ€™ve split the build into three parallel parts: the SMC engine, a read-only MT5 data service, and the new chart/research interface. The engine will record when each signal became knowable, so a historical chart cannot silently use future candles to produce better-looking results.\n\nYour PC has 16 GB of RAM, so Iâ€™m also adding limits and cancellation to keep larger tick downloads and repeated tests manageable.", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 75, "text_sha256": "1d86528d166854b7b3384a60353382b0a4add00c653b98ca2b13fc6776134d5e", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 493, "timestamp": "2026-10-15T10:20:05.141Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad0a8d2d7708191991e599696634167", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The new data EA is now running on your Exness demo connection. It found all 11 requested markets, including their actual `m` suffixes, and is publishing live prices and contract details.\n\nThe research screen will keep three results separate: the optimized training result, untouched validation results, and native MT5 verification. This will let you see whether a PF above 2 survives beyond the data used to select the settings."], "text": "The new data EA is now running on your Exness demo connection. It found all 11 requested markets, including their actual `m` suffixes, and is publishing live prices and contract details.\n\nThe research screen will keep three results separate: the optimized training result, untouched validation results, and native MT5 verification. This will let you see whether a PF above 2 survives beyond the data used to select the settings.", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 76, "text_sha256": "8c035579fc003741e9f1d7fbe02d27d0c009b2555a568f3f98ed9445e6478119", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 646, "timestamp": "2026-10-15T10:26:38.336Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad0aa5c19d08191a214262c7ecfa6e8", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The live chart is working in the new interface. The SMC engine now has three explicit strategy familiesâ€”structure continuation, sweep reversal, and breaker retestsâ€”and its tests cover delayed swing recognition, future-data leakage, Bid/Ask fills, costs, risk limits, and cancellation.\n\nIâ€™m now checking the full workflow with MT5 tick history, including Stop behaviour, saved results, deployment controls, and a separate native tester run."], "text": "The live chart is working in the new interface. The SMC engine now has three explicit strategy familiesâ€”structure continuation, sweep reversal, and breaker retestsâ€”and its tests cover delayed swing recognition, future-data leakage, Bid/Ask fills, costs, risk limits, and cancellation.\n\nIâ€™m now checking the full workflow with MT5 tick history, including Stop behaviour, saved results, deployment controls, and a separate native tester run.", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 77, "text_sha256": "7d3d1e880bf6a7feb6aa4d6446e01ac0302a53b30892f24500e1c1f05d6fadb5", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 762, "timestamp": "2026-10-15T10:32:49.735Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad0abcfe6548191a1950b635103879a", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The first end-to-end search completed on **870,206 genuine XAUUSDm ticks**. One training candidate reached PF **2.11**, but it had only **three trades** and did not produce qualifying holdout results. The app correctly marked it **Not ready**.\n\nIâ€™m also adding disk-backed replay for longer histories and a record of previously inspected evaluation windows. Repeatedly searching the same period should not make it appear to be fresh evidence."], "text": "The first end-to-end search completed on **870,206 genuine XAUUSDm ticks**. One training candidate reached PF **2.11**, but it had only **three trades** and did not produce qualifying holdout results. The app correctly marked it **Not ready**.\n\nIâ€™m also adding disk-backed replay for longer histories and a record of previously inspected evaluation windows. Repeatedly searching the same period should not make it appear to be fresh evidence.", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 78, "text_sha256": "c511449b4d9c5445f761e3dbafcf18de21df3f2c94965fc4327cc4c6b4a43137", "section": "conversation"}
