{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 801, "timestamp": "2026-10-15T10:43:24.605Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad0ae4be77c8191b9c11b44cebec02a", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["Iâ€™m continuing with the remaining checks: longer-history replay, native MT5 comparison, local AI setup, and the Windows installer. Iâ€™ll also verify deployment and deactivation without placing any real-money orders."], "text": "Iâ€™m continuing with the remaining checks: longer-history replay, native MT5 comparison, local AI setup, and the Windows installer. Iâ€™ll also verify deployment and deactivation without placing any real-money orders.", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 80, "text_sha256": "22db70d12a299286a8ef3f2d24b4b719444bb317aa3bf8e14dd26433ef8570bf", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 908, "timestamp": "2026-10-15T10:48:51.924Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad0af9350a88191864c9d2f62d971a4", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["All three SMC models now match their MQL5 versions on deterministic test data: the signals, structure events, and trades agree across the two implementations.\n\nThe Windows build passes its automated checks. Iâ€™m finishing the comparison on actual MT5 ticks and installing a small local AI model suitable for this PC. The AI will explain research results; the tested strategy engine will control signals."], "text": "All three SMC models now match their MQL5 versions on deterministic test data: the signals, structure events, and trades agree across the two implementations.\n\nThe Windows build passes its automated checks. Iâ€™m finishing the comparison on actual MT5 ticks and installing a small local AI model suitable for this PC. The AI will explain research results; the tested strategy engine will control signals.", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 81, "text_sha256": "8a6807ed97a2a4acf095ace405afb3307943872619dd4a0c94a22a4b6cafc760", "section": "conversation"}
