{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 1168, "timestamp": "2026-10-15T11:05:31.076Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad0b378586481918bb8892a8360077b", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The interface has now been checked on your laptop display, including charts, results, deployment controls, and local AI. The data EA is attached to a persistent chart, and opening a separate bridge chart for another symbol passed its connection check.\n\nThe other two models also passed native implementation checks. Their example native PFs were 1.13 and 0.95; neither qualifies as the profitable strategy youâ€™re targeting. Iâ€™m now packaging the release and saving the source to GitHub."], "text": "The interface has now been checked on your laptop display, including charts, results, deployment controls, and local AI. The data EA is attached to a persistent chart, and opening a separate bridge chart for another symbol passed its connection check.\n\nThe other two models also passed native implementation checks. Their example native PFs were 1.13 and 0.95; neither qualifies as the profitable strategy youâ€™re targeting. Iâ€™m now packaging the release and saving the source to GitHub.", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 83, "text_sha256": "3d5ff9acbb774d677714733848273605d6a223ec5ca1a737e815ffc50162a67e", "section": "conversation"}
