{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 4158, "timestamp": "2026-10-15T17:08:18.745Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad10880f4048191aad134f540c6ac54", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["Iâ€™m continuing with the published rules, explicit mathematics and controlled backtests. Each strategy will have a fixed hypothesis, bounded variables and recorded rejection reasons. Careful research can improve the process, but it cannot guarantee an edge; Iâ€™ll use the results to decide what earns further testing.\n"], "text": "Iâ€™m continuing with the published rules, explicit mathematics and controlled backtests. Each strategy will have a fixed hypothesis, bounded variables and recorded rejection reasons. Careful research can improve the process, but it cannot guarantee an edge; Iâ€™ll use the results to decide what earns further testing.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 133, "text_sha256": "d90cd72e41a19d1c462b3864f3992861550c51c614ea742594398e5e70406e01", "section": "conversation"}
