{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 7875, "timestamp": "2026-10-15T21:22:49.803Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad144264e5081919e08dc1d2e278d95", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The audit found a median XAUUSDm spread of **$0.260/oz**, a 95th percentile of **$0.360**, and a maximum of **$2.000** across Aprilâ€“October 2026. The previous 2-point slippage buffer is only **$0.002/oz**, so it is too small to treat as a realistic assumption.\n\nAmong the sampled quotes with a timely follow-up, adverse movement at the 95th percentile was about **$0.30 after 100 ms** and **$0.42 after 1 second**. These are quote-movement estimates, not measured live fills. The current quote check also returned one unchanged Gold timestamp throughout; that sample cannot establish an updating live feed.\n"], "text": "The audit found a median XAUUSDm spread of **$0.260/oz**, a 95th percentile of **$0.360**, and a maximum of **$2.000** across Aprilâ€“October 2026. The previous 2-point slippage buffer is only **$0.002/oz**, so it is too small to treat as a realistic assumption.\n\nAmong the sampled quotes with a timely follow-up, adverse movement at the 95th percentile was about **$0.30 after 100 ms** and **$0.42 after 1 second**. These are quote-movement estimates, not measured live fills. The current quote check also returned one unchanged Gold timestamp throughout; that sample cannot establish an updating live feed.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 190, "text_sha256": "82c4c5d4690768c5d71999a2b8926e8965f0065b47e4c267d0ad5b72c35f9064", "section": "conversation"}
