{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 12864, "timestamp": "2026-10-16T02:29:40.552Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad18c108bc4819187defa97e9e16ac6", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The independent audit reconciled all 1,918 EURUSD trades and 9,782 numerical comparisons without a discrepancy. It confirmed the modeled fills, fees, risk and balances; it did not independently replay full tick-by-tick drawdown.\n\nThe new scorecard also checked both saved learning pilots. Both learners predicted worse than the simple prior-outcome benchmark. MarketLink 3.5 now exposes that result, so weight updates alone wonâ€™t be mistaken for improvement. Iâ€™m installing and preserving the verified build.\n"], "text": "The independent audit reconciled all 1,918 EURUSD trades and 9,782 numerical comparisons without a discrepancy. It confirmed the modeled fills, fees, risk and balances; it did not independently replay full tick-by-tick drawdown.\n\nThe new scorecard also checked both saved learning pilots. Both learners predicted worse than the simple prior-outcome benchmark. MarketLink 3.5 now exposes that result, so weight updates alone wonâ€™t be mistaken for improvement. Iâ€™m installing and preserving the verified build.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 266, "text_sha256": "9c007662c7435b597024e40ce9304d63871d0db000ddcda5be4f76e4fb10a29e", "section": "conversation"}
