{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 13574, "timestamp": "2026-10-16T03:20:10.630Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad197e63f608191be8f4386ea57fdf9", "role": "assistant", "phase": "final_answer", "parts": ["MarketLink **3.5.0â€™s self-learning workspace is installed**: **Local AI â†’ Self-learning engine â†’ Learning quality**.\n\nFurther research is now saved and pushed to your private GitHub repository:\n\n- Tested eight fixed accounts on **3.86 million 2026 Exness ticks**.\n- Primary PF: **0.71 standard / 0.62 stressed**â€”failed.\n- Independent audit: **910 trades, zero discrepancies**.\n- No strategy activated or orders submitted.\n\n[Full results](<C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Desktop/codex/mt5-desktop-bridge/docs/EURUSD-FIXING-RESULTS-2026.md>)\n\nThe profitability goal remains active. The next proposed learning experiment tests forgetting stale outcomes; it is not enabled yet.\n\n"], "text": "MarketLink **3.5.0â€™s self-learning workspace is installed**: **Local AI â†’ Self-learning engine â†’ Learning quality**.\n\nFurther research is now saved and pushed to your private GitHub repository:\n\n- Tested eight fixed accounts on **3.86 million 2026 Exness ticks**.\n- Primary PF: **0.71 standard / 0.62 stressed**â€”failed.\n- Independent audit: **910 trades, zero discrepancies**.\n- No strategy activated or orders submitted.\n\n[Full results](<C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Desktop/codex/mt5-desktop-bridge/docs/EURUSD-FIXING-RESULTS-2026.md>)\n\nThe profitability goal remains active. The next proposed learning experiment tests forgetting stale outcomes; it is not enabled yet.\n\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 280, "text_sha256": "86501ba5a52e02e97f27ecde900ef20f10f6dfb736a44f765817302cc4337015", "section": "conversation"}
