{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 13966, "timestamp": "2026-10-16T03:38:23.593Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad19c2e79388191aac045ba3ea68c2a", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The first cost profile has finished all four account replays. The process is now checking the non-forgetting control against the earlier retained experiment before moving on.\n\nIâ€™ll keep the source unchanged until all six profiles finish. Every returned account and the completed forecasts are being saved as checkpoints.\n"], "text": "The first cost profile has finished all four account replays. The process is now checking the non-forgetting control against the earlier retained experiment before moving on.\n\nIâ€™ll keep the source unchanged until all six profiles finish. Every returned account and the completed forecasts are being saved as checkpoints.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 285, "text_sha256": "c2f7a12bc7ebc96136b27e0c31f1124294b0a4893b33a667fcf83f187963fc79", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 14014, "timestamp": "2026-10-16T03:42:04.733Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad19d0b809c8191b7b9413bcb1eb38c", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The first two cost profiles completed and matched the retained non-forgetting control. The third profile has finished its account replays.\n\nThe process is using about **600 MB of memory**, and the PC has **41 GB free**. The independent audit is being prepared while the remaining profiles run; Iâ€™ll report the full cohort after completion.\n"], "text": "The first two cost profiles completed and matched the retained non-forgetting control. The third profile has finished its account replays.\n\nThe process is using about **600 MB of memory**, and the PC has **41 GB free**. The independent audit is being prepared while the remaining profiles run; Iâ€™ll report the full cohort after completion.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 286, "text_sha256": "0cb549faab81a44bf8b31ee08f587fa280f496b61865db418defafc4757ef1ed", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 14120, "timestamp": "2026-10-16T03:48:46.171Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad19e9c9be4819191eab79254f7fcc7", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["Five profiles have completed. The final stress profile is running.\n\nThe independent checker is ready and has passed **446 synthetic comparisons**. It will rebuild the features and forecasts and check the account arithmetic against original quotes. Its scope excludes complete SMC signal regeneration and a separate full-quote drawdown replay, so those checks will not be represented as verified.\n"], "text": "Five profiles have completed. The final stress profile is running.\n\nThe independent checker is ready and has passed **446 synthetic comparisons**. It will rebuild the features and forecasts and check the account arithmetic against original quotes. Its scope excludes complete SMC signal regeneration and a separate full-quote drawdown replay, so those checks will not be represented as verified.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 287, "text_sha256": "014ad22f921a52f4e1c91f0d73cceeebf9b10ed505095d81302399a61c980296", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 14153, "timestamp": "2026-10-16T03:51:24.449Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad19f3aa3b8819180582a76a270b12b", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The full cohort finished. **None of the 18 learner policies passed.** The forgetting model produced PF **0.832 with 21 trades** under the 322-point profile, and **0.925 with 4 trades** under stress. Both lost money and fell below the required sample size.\n\nIt also failed the paired forecast-improvement gate. Iâ€™ve started the independent audit; this model is not being promoted.\n"], "text": "The full cohort finished. **None of the 18 learner policies passed.** The forgetting model produced PF **0.832 with 21 trades** under the 322-point profile, and **0.925 with 4 trades** under stress. Both lost money and fell below the required sample size.\n\nIt also failed the paired forecast-improvement gate. Iâ€™ve started the independent audit; this model is not being promoted.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 288, "text_sha256": "69cdd4be2aa6f650c7c3853904206e78500f86fdc4df05671f13dca80cc3b30c", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 14181, "timestamp": "2026-10-16T03:53:35.577Z", "message_id": "msg_0cd24f301e66c822016ad19fbe298481919cc3a94d60f78363", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["Iâ€™m resuming the independent audit from its existing process handle. The adaptive cohort has already finished and failed its development gates; Iâ€™ll verify and preserve that result before making another change.\n"], "text": "Iâ€™m resuming the independent audit from its existing process handle. The adaptive cohort has already finished and failed its development gates; Iâ€™ll verify and preserve that result before making another change.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 289, "text_sha256": "54c401b97d07b81ab222789eb2596fa1b453f5d964ce1de4fb8ecd6a788474c6", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 14215, "timestamp": "2026-10-16T03:54:42.812Z", "message_id": "msg_0cd24f301e66c822016ad19fff8f888191abcca096f6c17a16", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The interruption removed the audit process before it produced a report. I verified that its handle and OS process were both gone, then restarted only the read-only audit. The experiment itself has not been rerun.\n\nI also found a useful next step: the learner currently lacks numerical spread and stop-distance features. Iâ€™m adding decision-time recording so a later, separately declared experiment can use those values without borrowing information from future fills.\n"], "text": "The interruption removed the audit process before it produced a report. I verified that its handle and OS process were both gone, then restarted only the read-only audit. The experiment itself has not been rerun.\n\nI also found a useful next step: the learner currently lacks numerical spread and stop-distance features. Iâ€™m adding decision-time recording so a later, separately declared experiment can use those values without borrowing information from future fills.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 290, "text_sha256": "27a8927d994467a53f7989f970fa60741059c21ab1d533c9cf1bfc6cc074d137", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 14284, "timestamp": "2026-10-16T03:57:08.966Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad1a0925204819195a86068c5ab3069", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The audit has reached the first profileâ€™s forecasts and account ledgers after rebuilding candles from all **42.76 million quotes**.\n\nThe new recorder will capture each pending signal when it is recognized, including signals later rejected or expired. It will keep spread, known ATR, stop candidate and quote order, while leaving actual fills, profit and risk amounts out of the decision snapshot. It will not change trading decisions.\n"], "text": "The audit has reached the first profileâ€™s forecasts and account ledgers after rebuilding candles from all **42.76 million quotes**.\n\nThe new recorder will capture each pending signal when it is recognized, including signals later rejected or expired. It will keep spread, known ATR, stop candidate and quote order, while leaving actual fills, profit and risk amounts out of the decision snapshot. It will not change trading decisions.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 291, "text_sha256": "db8c13eaee4881ca5c7a07a5f852d86f139d53b9ac680b0532cc4ddb274d9b82", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 14332, "timestamp": "2026-10-16T03:58:25.265Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad1a0de34b881919103c573f0d376e1", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The independent audit completed with **1,239,012 comparisons and zero discrepancies** across **7,834 trades in all 24 accounts**. It confirmed the failed learner results and matched the non-forgetting controls to the earlier experiment.\n\nThis verifies the scoped calculations and forecast chronology, not profitability or native execution. The goal remains unmet. Iâ€™m preserving the report and finishing the decision recorder for the next cost-aware learning experiment.\n"], "text": "The independent audit completed with **1,239,012 comparisons and zero discrepancies** across **7,834 trades in all 24 accounts**. It confirmed the failed learner results and matched the non-forgetting controls to the earlier experiment.\n\nThis verifies the scoped calculations and forecast chronology, not profitability or native execution. The goal remains unmet. Iâ€™m preserving the report and finishing the decision recorder for the next cost-aware learning experiment.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 292, "text_sha256": "40836c634b546e6a38401bac11b4a0dfb099d17b2dc25bf26bbb5311e6e861d8", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 14410, "timestamp": "2026-10-16T04:02:02.258Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad1a1b749a88191a82d8e318217a7fc", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The complete failed adaptive cohort and its independent audit are now preserved on GitHub.\n\nThe next change is limited to recording decision-time evidence. Iâ€™ll check that enabling it leaves trades, costs, events and equity unchanged, then use the retained ticks to verify the capture. It will not retune or replace the failed learner.\n"], "text": "The complete failed adaptive cohort and its independent audit are now preserved on GitHub.\n\nThe next change is limited to recording decision-time evidence. Iâ€™ll check that enabling it leaves trades, costs, events and equity unchanged, then use the retained ticks to verify the capture. It will not retune or replace the failed learner.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 293, "text_sha256": "2431f97d496f2c5c4fb668d87dcd81438b36ab9a0b3116f5c833ff4a76fd536e", "section": "conversation"}
