dit: **20â€“35 minutes**. The updated results screen and packaging will likely need **another 1â€“2 hours**, depending on checks.\n\nI canâ€™t honestly give one percentage for the entire project or a completion time for achieving profitability. The engine is real progress, but passing software tests does not prove profitable trading. Iâ€™m continuing the run.", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 326, "text_sha256": "c020be26c7719e9240d9fd09d289c764000b595a9b253f19598c8e83d1ce8a44", "section": "conversation"}
