{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 31352, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T08:07:00.221Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad32ca2da148191a4889073e671d160", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["MT5 has returned about **18.96 million original tick records** for the 90-day window. The app is checking their order and prices, then cross-checking minute coverage against native MT5 bars.\n\nAfter that, the census will show how many setups survive each stage. Profit-factor testing is still pending.\n"], "text": "MT5 has returned about **18.96 million original tick records** for the 90-day window. The app is checking their order and prices, then cross-checking minute coverage against native MT5 bars.\n\nAfter that, the census will show how many setups survive each stage. Profit-factor testing is still pending.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 533, "text_sha256": "3871df096e0dd3e9fb5acd305fc4f8d0349c53481af44d79752a644224baa5e7", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 31406, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T08:10:04.312Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad32d5a3f308191916bd02b9dfcfe78", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The census found a clear limitation in the first contextual model: **2 entry intents across all 90 days**, versus **48** for the local baseline. Those counts are before execution costs and do not meet the required trade sample.\n\nI wonâ€™t spend hours tuning exits around that shortage. Iâ€™m adding an early capacity check and moving the research toward the separately documented Silver Bullet continuation/FVG approach, which doesnâ€™t require a fresh external raid for every entry.\n"], "text": "The census found a clear limitation in the first contextual model: **2 entry intents across all 90 days**, versus **48** for the local baseline. Those counts are before execution costs and do not meet the required trade sample.\n\nI wonâ€™t spend hours tuning exits around that shortage. Iâ€™m adding an early capacity check and moving the research toward the separately documented Silver Bullet continuation/FVG approach, which doesnâ€™t require a fresh external raid for every entry.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 534, "text_sha256": "64ac4bdbd89fe0b6dcd476c190b94f3e60b2330dd8e817398d7862a5d249dfaa", "section": "conversation"}
