{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 37360, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:09:08.056Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3c7d2b6848191b77a33e7ad755339", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["Iâ€™m continuing with the ICT core. The next experiment will test a point-of-interest reaction followed by a completed M5 change in delivery, allowing the sequence to span candles. Iâ€™ll define and test those rules before measuring them against the original Exness ticks.\n"], "text": "Iâ€™m continuing with the ICT core. The next experiment will test a point-of-interest reaction followed by a completed M5 change in delivery, allowing the sequence to span candles. Iâ€™ll define and test those rules before measuring them against the original Exness ticks.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 620, "text_sha256": "f9316c9f362f12f04d41a3b6e9bdb746bafb1f937e25b492cccb33865e5f2bee", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 37379, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:09:36.533Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3c7ee15448191a19da701f1b1a110", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The published protected-swing method confirms a reaction by a close through the opposing candle series, with the swing extreme defining invalidation. That gives us a basis for testing this sequence separately from the stricter positional model. It remains an experiment, not evidence of profitability. [TTradesâ€™ protected-swing lesson](https://ttrades.com/stop-loss-mastery-using-protected-swings-for-precise-invalidations/)\n\nThe UTC check also confirms that the existing corpus already covers the latest 90 completed days: 19 Julyâ€“16 October. Iâ€™ll reuse it without claiming coverage of an unfinished day.\n"], "text": "The published protected-swing method confirms a reaction by a close through the opposing candle series, with the swing extreme defining invalidation. That gives us a basis for testing this sequence separately from the stricter positional model. It remains an experiment, not evidence of profitability. [TTradesâ€™ protected-swing lesson](https://ttrades.com/stop-loss-mastery-using-protected-swings-for-precise-invalidations/)\n\nThe UTC check also confirms that the existing corpus already covers the latest 90 completed days: 19 Julyâ€“16 October. Iâ€™ll reuse it without claiming coverage of an unfinished day.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 621, "text_sha256": "1abb6710e8ba112aa4e5372c0173734d22f609c47cc67da8ee14ca427c7ef6c7", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 37394, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:10:19.550Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3c81ad7d081919816efd1e2eb1616", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["Iâ€™m recording the new rules in the repository using the writing skillâ€™s clarity checks. This experiment will use M5 confirmation and M5 volatility for entry costs, while retaining the existing fees, slippage assumptions and risk limits. It will keep B7â€™s rules and results intact.\n"], "text": "Iâ€™m recording the new rules in the repository using the writing skillâ€™s clarity checks. This experiment will use M5 confirmation and M5 volatility for entry costs, while retaining the existing fees, slippage assumptions and risk limits. It will keep B7â€™s rules and results intact.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 622, "text_sha256": "19dea89cd212c6ac1c2af3b3a2dc6975fa3b004ebefbbc5527670fdeca9d7bb0", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 37440, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:14:32.036Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3c917308081919b5357682fde54d5", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The new registry has passed 36 synthetic test groups, including first-contact consumption, gaps, expiry and exact original-quote ordering. The core tests are running now to check that contacts cannot be attached to earlier candles and that a weak first confirmation cannot be rescued by a later candle.\n"], "text": "The new registry has passed 36 synthetic test groups, including first-contact consumption, gaps, expiry and exact original-quote ordering. The core tests are running now to check that contacts cannot be attached to earlier candles and that a weak first confirmation cannot be rescued by a later candle.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 623, "text_sha256": "a754d4a4cb55d0bade886f44d43080bac973c64bfa7cdbeee71fc7aa93565906", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 37496, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:17:21.754Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3c9c018c081918a19f043dac1f873", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The core now passes 29 synthetic groups, including BUY/SELL tests using the production POI and objective registries; 32 shared execution-cost groups also pass. One test fixture initially placed its POI outside its allowed lifetime. I corrected the fixture and retained the failed run.\n\nIâ€™m preparing the four fixed variants for the 90-day opportunity census. This will show whether enough setups survive the entry-cost checks before account-level replay.\n"], "text": "The core now passes 29 synthetic groups, including BUY/SELL tests using the production POI and objective registries; 32 shared execution-cost groups also pass. One test fixture initially placed its POI outside its allowed lifetime. I corrected the fixture and retained the failed run.\n\nIâ€™m preparing the four fixed variants for the 90-day opportunity census. This will show whether enough setups survive the entry-cost checks before account-level replay.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 624, "text_sha256": "17cc64867666b612f16ba6c1c4dad37229994c5692000f1099400326b7c87b70", "section": "conversation"}
