{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 37613, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:21:14.737Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3caa992c0819186c759959d331918", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The broader variant has produced 66 signals after warmup; 58 pass Primary entry conditions and 43 pass Stress. That is below the unchanged sample requirements. Costs reject fewer entries than before, but too many confirmed reactions lack enough room to the frozen objective.\n\nIâ€™m checking the completed reports and their arithmetic before deciding what to test next.\n"], "text": "The broader variant has produced 66 signals after warmup; 58 pass Primary entry conditions and 43 pass Stress. That is below the unchanged sample requirements. Costs reject fewer entries than before, but too many confirmed reactions lack enough room to the frozen objective.\n\nIâ€™m checking the completed reports and their arithmetic before deciding what to test next.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 626, "text_sha256": "bc55a2be4c5083cc2fc779cf3122315ee5e82a4622a7f891684c738ef565aaaa", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 37655, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:23:46.209Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3cb41111481918898f71afadbc748", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["All four variants completed, and the independent report/arithmetic audit passed. Each still falls short of the sample requirements.\n\nIâ€™m now checking the saved setups directly against the original tick file: POI formation and first contact, protected extremes, M5 bars, prior ATR, confirmation and the next Bid/Ask quote.\n"], "text": "All four variants completed, and the independent report/arithmetic audit passed. Each still falls short of the sample requirements.\n\nIâ€™m now checking the saved setups directly against the original tick file: POI formation and first contact, protected extremes, M5 bars, prior ATR, confirmation and the next Bid/Ask quote.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 627, "text_sha256": "7e0ef0faddc73d44255f3783a1c5fb462c0b634ce4ad359b4c8115450209d251", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 37702, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:26:00.223Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3cbc771c48191b4f7a5087c645c4e", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The original-tick check passed for all 198 saved setups, covering 77 distinct POIs and all 198 next-quote bindings. The independent audit also verified 594 cost assessments and rejected all 31 deliberate report corruptions.\n\nThat supports the implementationâ€™s timing and arithmetic. The sample shortfall remains, so these variants do not qualify for deployment.\n"], "text": "The original-tick check passed for all 198 saved setups, covering 77 distinct POIs and all 198 next-quote bindings. The independent audit also verified 594 cost assessments and rejected all 31 deliberate report corruptions.\n\nThat supports the implementationâ€™s timing and arithmetic. The sample shortfall remains, so these variants do not qualify for deployment.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 628, "text_sha256": "67939da8780ad3a1cc0d11c21cb7d18040f82b4f8486b001c76161f57786eeaa", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 37771, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:29:26.464Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3cc95c4a08191b02bee107737c042", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["A separate code review found no actionable defect in the new coreâ€™s timing and state handling. Iâ€™m publishing the sanitized source, tests and results to your private repository. The installed app remains unchanged; B8 stays a research experiment because its sample requirements failed.\n"], "text": "A separate code review found no actionable defect in the new coreâ€™s timing and state handling. Iâ€™m publishing the sanitized source, tests and results to your private repository. The installed app remains unchanged; B8 stays a research experiment because its sample requirements failed.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 629, "text_sha256": "ffc67d0d9af9fd73f4a92d632a792fd393c58c4c57bc0bd16e290b8dcd6c758b", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 37788, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:30:05.076Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3ccbb0e44819199c22eb8b56d24d0", "role": "assistant", "phase": "final_answer", "parts": ["The new ICT core experiment is built and tested on **18.96 million original Exness ticks**.\n\n- 97 test groups passed.\n- 198 saved setups were independently checked against original ticks.\n- Largest variant: 66 signals; 58 passed initial Primary cost checks.\n\n**It still fails the sample requirements; no strategy qualifies yet.** Source and results are published to your private GitHub repository.\n\n[Detailed results](</C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Desktop/codex/mt5-desktop-bridge/docs/ICT-STANDARD-CISD-B8-RESULTS-2026.md>)\n\n"], "text": "The new ICT core experiment is built and tested on **18.96 million original Exness ticks**.\n\n- 97 test groups passed.\n- 198 saved setups were independently checked against original ticks.\n- Largest variant: 66 signals; 58 passed initial Primary cost checks.\n\n**It still fails the sample requirements; no strategy qualifies yet.** Source and results are published to your private GitHub repository.\n\n[Detailed results](</C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Desktop/codex/mt5-desktop-bridge/docs/ICT-STANDARD-CISD-B8-RESULTS-2026.md>)\n\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 630, "text_sha256": "cd20056bb65076be04af71ff11656b2db63a4ddfa5a2d53f447e982398e6081b", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 37798, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:30:18.984Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3ccc9ce3081918b72f01a9414de9a", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["Iâ€™m moving from signal counts to account-level results. Iâ€™ll run the frozen B8 rules through a cost-aware replay, then use its win/loss and exit diagnostics to guide the next experiment. The PF, sample and deployment requirements will stay unchanged.\n"], "text": "Iâ€™m moving from signal counts to account-level results. Iâ€™ll run the frozen B8 rules through a cost-aware replay, then use its win/loss and exit diagnostics to guide the next experiment. The PF, sample and deployment requirements will stay unchanged.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 631, "text_sha256": "8aabcc00ea2b1f94f9af0868b9f1d42834dd3b6daafc603069ac6bbedbb0fe89", "section": "conversation"}
