{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 38878, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T20:12:11.492Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3d697f08c819185df13e3f535c6f4", "role": "assistant", "phase": "final_answer", "parts": ["Completed and audited all **12 ICT diagnostic accounts**.\n\n- Highest Primary PF: **2.9470**, 29 trades, **1.14% drawdown**.\n- Same configuration under Stress costs: **PF 2.1110**, 25 trades.\n- Latest Primary segment: **PF 0.5623**, five trades.\n\n**No strategy qualifies yet:** samples are insufficient, and recent performance is weak. The independent audit checked all 18.96 million original quotes and matched the saved executions and drawdown.\n\n[Full results](</C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Desktop/codex/mt5-desktop-bridge/docs/ICT-STANDARD-CISD-B8-ACCOUNT-RESULTS-2026.md>). Reviewed source is published as `cc7dfd8`; the installed app remains unchanged.\n\nNext is implementing the researched continuation model.\n\n"], "text": "Completed and audited all **12 ICT diagnostic accounts**.\n\n- Highest Primary PF: **2.9470**, 29 trades, **1.14% drawdown**.\n- Same configuration under Stress costs: **PF 2.1110**, 25 trades.\n- Latest Primary segment: **PF 0.5623**, five trades.\n\n**No strategy qualifies yet:** samples are insufficient, and recent performance is weak. The independent audit checked all 18.96 million original quotes and matched the saved executions and drawdown.\n\n[Full results](</C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Desktop/codex/mt5-desktop-bridge/docs/ICT-STANDARD-CISD-B8-ACCOUNT-RESULTS-2026.md>). Reviewed source is published as `cc7dfd8`; the installed app remains unchanged.\n\nNext is implementing the researched continuation model.\n\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 652, "text_sha256": "8144bc6280d0062ab87706c35b71f785f2b2a18c8fb34f04423434043e1c728e", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 38888, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T20:12:20.269Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3d6a36ec08191a46eec8d5be29542", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The last turn completed the twelve-account replay and independent audit. Iâ€™m now implementing the separate continuation model: a confirmed swing establishes direction, then a later retracement and fresh confirmation must create a new protected stop. The existing B8 code and results will stay unchanged.\n"], "text": "The last turn completed the twelve-account replay and independent audit. Iâ€™m now implementing the separate continuation model: a confirmed swing establishes direction, then a later retracement and fresh confirmation must create a new protected stop. The existing B8 code and results will stay unchanged.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 653, "text_sha256": "f38244e2fd153a762839bdbe54d245d5cb8e4f1bcdc78ca9d8d8e621932c549a", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 38969, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T21:25:04.381Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3e7a4f6508191b98686fcaac809ca", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The implementation is split into three parts: a seed observer, an M5 retracement registry, and the continuation entry logic. This keeps the original confirmation separate from the later entry and makes it possible to test whether any step accidentally uses future prices.\n"], "text": "The implementation is split into three parts: a seed observer, an M5 retracement registry, and the continuation entry logic. This keeps the original confirmation separate from the later entry and makes it possible to test whether any step accidentally uses future prices.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 654, "text_sha256": "be63ddcd304b340f851fd02cb5fdfef81433d5c769ad88e8df88bd00610cb80e", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 39018, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T21:27:25.526Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3e83ca48c81918415171affc72686", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The seed observer has passed its first 30 synthetic test groups, including BUY/SELL symmetry and retaining valid structural seeds when immediate-entry reward room is insufficient. Iâ€™m integrating it with the retracement registry and checking the timing rules before using market data.\n"], "text": "The seed observer has passed its first 30 synthetic test groups, including BUY/SELL symmetry and retaining valid structural seeds when immediate-entry reward room is insufficient. Iâ€™m integrating it with the retracement registry and checking the timing rules before using market data.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 655, "text_sha256": "056b432de0cb6fb54c3c77b9815482686415447656ba5e49f67044e1d6dbaea1", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 39132, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T21:33:06.689Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3e99198408191915b2438726ecb53", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["Review caught two edge cases before market replay: a completed three-reaction cycle could discard a valid new seed, and an extremely small ATR could round a stop back onto the protected price. Both are fixed. The integration tests will check those cases alongside first-crossing, expiry and next-quote rules.\n"], "text": "Review caught two edge cases before market replay: a completed three-reaction cycle could discard a valid new seed, and an extremely small ATR could round a stop back onto the protected price. Both are fixed. The integration tests will check those cases alongside first-crossing, expiry and next-quote rules.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 656, "text_sha256": "3020b24df9babfc138c91490a302acecc2e224ebaac78e7eeaa4c5ac8d9a867e", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 39222, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T21:37:50.818Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad3eaadce9881918f0248aeb5c545ce", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The registry passed 33 test groups, and the integrated core passed 30, including complete invented tick sequences that produce later BUY and SELL continuations. Iâ€™m running the combined build now. The new census helper also preserves a partial checkpoint on interruption, alongside completed variants.\n"], "text": "The registry passed 33 test groups, and the integrated core passed 30, including complete invented tick sequences that produce later BUY and SELL continuations. Iâ€™m running the combined build now. The new census helper also preserves a partial checkpoint on interruption, alongside completed variants.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 657, "text_sha256": "cd0c6b4428018ae037a75c8bf1b42bf04b8414ec47b73143031d93f9b9a36f4b", "section": "conversation"}
