{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 39363, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T21:45:04.609Z", "message_id": "msg_008a0b1dd3e1111d016ad3ec5d804c8191ae571c0b77cdc18a", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The ICT core is progressing, but it is **not ready for deployment**.\n\n- The completed cost-aware test used **18.96 million Exness ticks**. Its best full-period PF was **2.95 on 29 trades**, but the sample was too small and its latest-period results lost money, so it did not qualify.\n- The new continuation core now passes **31 focused tests**. It checks fresh confirmation, protected swings, entry timing, costs and decision history.\n- That new core still needs its market-data backtest and integration into the installed UI.\n- The basic local AI component exists; the full multi-tool LLM manager remains for later.\n\nIâ€™m continuing with the combined checks and the new coreâ€™s tick-data test. I canâ€™t honestly give a completion percentage or a time estimate for reaching PF 2."], "text": "The ICT core is progressing, but it is **not ready for deployment**.\n\n- The completed cost-aware test used **18.96 million Exness ticks**. Its best full-period PF was **2.95 on 29 trades**, but the sample was too small and its latest-period results lost money, so it did not qualify.\n- The new continuation core now passes **31 focused tests**. It checks fresh confirmation, protected swings, entry timing, costs and decision history.\n- That new core still needs its market-data backtest and integration into the installed UI.\n- The basic local AI component exists; the full multi-tool LLM manager remains for later.\n\nIâ€™m continuing with the combined checks and the new coreâ€™s tick-data test. I canâ€™t honestly give a completion percentage or a time estimate for reaching PF 2.", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 661, "text_sha256": "f3f53dea636152875c996efd72d9fe85164a91256febbac25325f4fc321