{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 39429, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T21:46:12.244Z", "message_id": "msg_008a0b1dd3e1111d016ad3eca373848191b8cdb7680a316289", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The combined build check has now passed **126 test groups**, and the research helper compiled successfully. Iâ€™m independently checking its saved decisions before running it on market data. Those are software checks; they do not establish profitability."], "text": "The combined build check has now passed **126 test groups**, and the research helper compiled successfully. Iâ€™m independently checking its saved decisions before running it on market data. Those are software checks; they do not establish profitability.", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 662, "text_sha256": "ac7de010ab9b92ae6b8bdca2a117cc25853dd66cbaa7532abb0aa52f89afdc76", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 39501, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T21:47:45.710Z", "message_id": "msg_008a0b1dd3e1111d016ad3ecfd2a388191aa5fcef5209b0ada", "role": "assistant", "phase": "final_answer", "parts": ["**The ICT module is progressing, but it is not deployment-ready.**\n\n- **Research/backtesting:** Tested 18.96 million Exness ticks with Bid/Ask spreads and additional cost assumptions.\n- **Best development result:** PF **2.95 on 29 trades**, but too few trades and losing latest-period results. It does **not** qualify.\n- **New ICT core:** Continuation logic implemented; **126 test groups passed** and the research build compiled.\n- **Still pending:** New coreâ€™s market-data backtest, financial validation and integration into the installed UI.\n- **LLM:** Basic local AI exists. The full multi-tool coordinator and project-specific training remain later work.\n\nThere is **no validated PF â‰¥1.7 strategy ready to deploy yet**. More testing time cannot guarantee profitability.\n\n[Read the completed backtest report](</C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Desktop/codex/mt5-desktop-bridge/docs/ICT-STANDARD-CISD-B8-ACCOUNT-RESULTS-2026.md>).\n\n"], "text": "**The ICT module is progressing, but it is not deployment-ready.**\n\n- **Research/backtesting:** Tested 18.96 million Exness ticks with Bid/Ask spreads and additional cost assumptions.\n- **Best development result:** PF **2.95 on 29 trades**, but too few trades and losing latest-period results. It does **not** qualify.\n- **New ICT core:** Continuation logic implemented; **126 test groups passed** and the research build compiled.\n- **Still pending:** New coreâ€™s market-data backtest, financial validation and integration into the installed UI.\n- **LLM:** Basic local AI exists. The full multi-tool coordinator and project-specific training remain later work.\n\nThere is **no validated PF â‰¥1.7 strategy ready to deploy yet**. More testing time cannot guarantee