{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 40418, "timestamp": "2026-10-17T22:28:41.512Z", "message_id": "msg_008a0b1dd3e1111d016ad3f6984f9c8191ac3735350acc6716", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["Iâ€™ll add CPU parallelism so independent backtests can use the available cores, with a worker setting and visible resource usage. Each individual replay must still process ticks in order.\n\nThe current engine runs on the CPU; it does not have a GPU backtesting backend. MT5 history downloading can also be broker-bound, so CPU use may stay low during that phase."], "text": "Iâ€™ll add CPU parallelism so independent backtests can use the available cores, with a worker setting and visible resource usage. Each individual replay must still process ticks in order.\n\nThe current engine runs on the CPU; it does not have a GPU backtesting backend. MT5 history downloading can also be broker-bound, so CPU use may stay low during that phase.", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 684, "text_sha256": "e2bbc9a474e0dcdcd3822b76d10fb718d20a0914ad79d99a1ef0fdc61e4bd636", "section": "conversation"}
