{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 48159, "timestamp": "2026-10-18T08:02:26.918Z", "message_id": "msg_0a78e4d9817c68ab016ad47d113e9c8191a687d60664303533", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The first full-account suite passes **21 test groups** through the genuine ICT pipeline. It checks hand-calculated fills, lot sizes, fees and PnL, plus entry timing and partial-result handling. These use invented data; a strict saved-result format and independent financial verifier are still required before a new broker-data pilot.\n"], "text": "The first full-account suite passes **21 test groups** through the genuine ICT pipeline. It checks hand-calculated fills, lot sizes, fees and PnL, plus entry timing and partial-result handling. These use invented data; a strict saved-result format and independent financial verifier are still required before a new broker-data pilot.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 849, "text_sha256": "5a4dbd0dd6ef9aeb50170cfe77d9b485547cbe97298e69eefb69330cacd329f8", "section": "conversation"}
