{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 48296, "timestamp": "2026-10-18T08:13:11.868Z", "message_id": "msg_0a78e4d9817c68ab016ad47f9676c88191bd729f19db7b64d8", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["Review found a sizing error at a lot-step boundary: rounded division could select 0.05 lots, reject it, and miss a valid 0.04-lot trade. Sizing now uses exact integer flooring. The tests also check that a committed close updates equity even if saving later diagnostics hits its evidence limit.\n"], "text": "Review found a sizing error at a lot-step boundary: rounded division could select 0.05 lots, reject it, and miss a valid 0.04-lot trade. Sizing now uses exact integer flooring. The tests also check that a committed close updates equity even if saving later diagnostics hits its evidence limit.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 851, "text_sha256": "009c6bf05ef01a92699e382422095be40f76f527ac4fa83f842b090258477e49", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 48364, "timestamp": "2026-10-18T08:16:42.231Z", "message_id": "msg_0a78e4d9817c68ab016ad480689b3c81919f0c984c0157ba83", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The new saved-result format now passes round-trip and malformed-data tests. It preserves exact decimal values, rejects changed schemas and proof flags, and saves each result to a new file whose contents and hash are checked after writing. Financial verification remains a separate step.\n"], "text": "The new saved-result format now passes round-trip and malformed-data tests. It preserves exact decimal values, rejects changed schemas and proof flags, and saves each result to a new file whose contents and hash are checked after writing. Financial verification remains a separate step.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 852, "text_sha256": "edb2aff3129e53b187db82261b8225497d89598aaa9f090ddec50bfc1b27ce37", "section": "conversation"}
