{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 48823, "timestamp": "2026-10-18T08:46:09.372Z", "message_id": "msg_0a78e4d9817c68ab016ad487505c648191aae94e6e00dee54f", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The new provenance tests caught a gap: a nested record could name a different source hash while the accountâ€™s top-level hash still matched. I fixed that check. Iâ€™m also testing Stop with an open simulated trade so a partial run cannot appear complete.\n"], "text": "The new provenance tests caught a gap: a nested record could name a different source hash while the accountâ€™s top-level hash still matched. I fixed that check. Iâ€™m also testing Stop with an open simulated trade so a partial run cannot appear complete.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 866, "text_sha256": "12ed728e942f9da578386a0c9a995f4099c38fee87faa82df387970c312724e4", "section": "conversation"}
