{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 53884, "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:36:18.424Z", "message_id": "msg_0f828a1fe0455d72016ad5039106748191b23ca0e42bfb14c0", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The reviewer has confirmed two defects: a callback could alter the census threshold, and a late file-close error could leave a result marked complete. Theyâ€™re also testing an executable-identity mismatch in the launcher. These are test-harness defects; no original-data run or trading order has been started.\n"], "text": "The reviewer has confirmed two defects: a callback could alter the census threshold, and a late file-close error could leave a result marked complete. Theyâ€™re also testing an executable-identity mismatch in the launcher. These are test-harness defects; no original-data run or trading order has been started.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 977, "text_sha256": "9039b836d920858b4d9195270e26939f212612baacbb38e61ef302a8e73c8a29", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 53945, "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:40:11.286Z", "message_id": "msg_0f828a1fe0455d72016ad5047a04608191a265d48bc244a8ea", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["Iâ€™ve patched all three findings: progress data is now read-only, late outer failures revoke completion, and the launcher binds the executable it actually copies to the reviewed binary hash. The rebuilt tests passed. Iâ€™m rerunning the launcher checks before independent verification of the fixes.\n"], "text": "Iâ€™ve patched all three findings: progress data is now read-only, late outer failures revoke completion, and the launcher binds the executable it actually copies to the reviewed binary hash. The rebuilt tests passed. Iâ€™m rerunning the launcher checks before independent verification of the fixes.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 978, "text_sha256": "e97984bc6a3a1097516b0f5633fa5e20c609d609199c44353b07dd1db2d19c30", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 53998, "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:43:53.679Z", "message_id": "msg_0f828a1fe0455d72016ad5055767ac8191b8db5c1ea58d613b", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The corrected harness passed 51 checks, and its controlled launcher probe passed. Independent verification is still running.\n\nMetaQuotesâ€™ documentation also clarified two account-validation requirements: non-exchange SL/TP execution uses current Bid/Ask, and real-tick mode can replace inconsistent tick data. Iâ€™ve recorded both for the native comparison. ([execution rules](https://www.metatrader5.com/en/terminal/help/algotrading/testing_features), [tick-data handling](https://www.mql5.com/en/docs/runtime/testing#real_ticks))\n"], "text": "The corrected harness passed 51 checks, and its controlled launcher probe passed. Independent verification is still running.\n\nMetaQuotesâ€™ documentation also clarified two account-validation requirements: non-exchange SL/TP execution uses current Bid/Ask, and real-tick mode can replace inconsistent tick data. Iâ€™ve recorded both for the native comparison. ([execution rules](https://www.metatrader5.com/en/terminal/help/algotrading/testing_features), [tick-data handling](https://www.mql5.com/en/docs/runtime/testing#real_ticks))\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 979, "text_sha256": "353d174966587ba6326d4e10f3cf6534cf1a9c1fc55e1cd5a11fbcd58abb14af", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 54041, "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:45:58.848Z", "message_id": "msg_0f828a1fe0455d72016ad505d584cc8191b08506ec93f6491c", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["All three fixes are independently verified: 14 assertions passed, and the wrong executable was rejected before launch. Iâ€™m freezing those reviewed versions and starting one training-only scan of the original Exness ticks. It will count opportunities without calculating profit or examining later-period strategy outcomes.\n"], "text": "All three fixes are independently verified: 14 assertions passed, and the wrong executable was rejected before launch. Iâ€™m freezing those reviewed versions and starting one training-only scan of the original Exness ticks. It will count opportunities without calculating profit or examining later-period strategy outcomes.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 980, "text_sha256": "99605f13f92e59e7af5dc34ba5bf7edf71efe5bbe8c87384fbae9bcdc0c16997", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 54075, "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:48:31.814Z", "message_id": "msg_0f828a1fe0455d72016ad5065ed4148191847585affe9c29b5", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The original run is active. Input verification has reached 70%; detector replay follows. I also checked the current read-only MT5 data service: its DEMO heartbeat is fresh, 11 symbols are available, and the installed app is responding. Free disk space remains about 30.9 GiB.\n"], "text": "The original run is active. Input verification has reached 70%; detector replay follows. I also checked the current read-only MT5 data service: its DEMO heartbeat is fresh, 11 symbols are available, and the installed app is responding. Free disk space remains about 30.9 GiB.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 981, "text_sha256": "8300f170c459ac65d94ad9dbae358e81aac65d78aac6f3bde5223f8724a2f34c", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 54121, "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:52:01.587Z", "message_id": "msg_0f828a1fe0455d72016ad5074038208191a2bda597115221e3", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["Input verification is complete, and training replay is underway. At the latest checkpoint it had processed about 3.74 million quotes and emitted 8 entry instructions. Those are intermediate counts; the 60-opportunity decision comes only after the full captured-training scan and final integrity check.\n"], "text": "Input verification is complete, and training replay is underway. At the latest checkpoint it had processed about 3.74 million quotes and emitted 8 entry instructions. Those are intermediate counts; the 60-opportunity decision comes only after the full captured-training scan and final integrity check.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 982, "text_sha256": "862796cb3bd83e6d5abd95321ec5d3cabc418dc89829e2ab65ac203422967a21", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 54178, "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:54:47.438Z", "message_id": "msg_0f828a1fe0455d72016ad507e66f38819189532c925cd63e36", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["While the scan runs, Iâ€™m using the PDF review skill to inspect the authorâ€™s breaker/FVG diagrams. This will clarify which parts of our rules match the illustrations and which are project choices. The running experiment remains frozen.\n"], "text": "While the scan runs, Iâ€™m using the PDF review skill to inspect the authorâ€™s breaker/FVG diagrams. This will clarify which parts of our rules match the illustrations and which are project choices. The running experiment remains frozen.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 983, "text_sha256": "3afffa1b0614514987526bfb576487f81e9bec2766bef2aff4f67bd4266235a8", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 54241, "timestamp": "2026-10-18T18:00:11.303Z", "message_id": "msg_00de34e27ff41075016ad5092a19a08191932b42cdf7c2823a", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The training scan finished successfully but found only **32 entry opportunities**, below the required 60. This fixed preset therefore fails the opportunity-count gate; it has no profitability result. Iâ€™m preserving the result, checking the saved journal independently, and using the findings to guide the next version.\n"], "text": "The training scan finished successfully but found only **32 entry opportunities**, below the required 60. This fixed preset therefore fails the opportunity-count gate; it has no profitability result. Iâ€™m preserving the result, checking the saved journal independently, and using the findings to guide the next version.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 984, "text_sha256": "0c017ecca4151a1875ff3fe0196d51d8cff7ea68b80ff455cc0d0a375a186249", "section": "conversation"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 54274, "timestamp": "2026-10-18T18:02:48.700Z", "message_id": "msg_00de34e27ff41075016ad509c71ea08191bfe80b6015590891", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The saved funnel explains the sparse result: 1,114 in-window episodes became 264 structure breaks, 68 valid overlap zones, 38 retests and 32 delayed instructions.\n\nIâ€™ve proposed a separate six-configuration experiment for two numerical choices made by this project: the displacement threshold and zone lifetime. It includes the unchanged V1 settings as a control. More opportunities would still need cost-aware testing to establish profitability.\n"], "text": "The saved funnel explains the sparse result: 1,114 in-window episodes became 264 structure breaks, 68 valid overlap zones, 38 retests and 32 delayed instructions.\n\nIâ€™ve proposed a separate six-configuration experiment for two numerical choices made by this project: the displacement threshold and zone lifetime. It includes the unchanged V1 settings as a control. More opportunities would still need cost-aware testing to establish profitability.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 985, "text_sha256": "238593ee362c308350ad4276d03002309f7d85647e3fd9576fea55db4ccd56b9", "section": "conversation"}
