s remain recorded; no profitable or deployment-ready result is being claimed.\n\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 998, "text_sha256": "a157d509f3a03aa1dd96dd5aa854c032a13dfeb86439bcf00e875c557de8bc75", "section": "conversation"}
