pportunities**â€”these are signals, not completed profitable trades.\n- **UI:** The new comparison, setup-details and verification screens passed **103 checks using actual saved reports**. [Preview the UI](<C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Desktop/codex/mt5-desktop-bridge/evidence/ict-unicorn-census-saved-report-smoke-20261018T192606Z-0ec9a3e1/unicorn-census-actual-v2-comparison.png>).\n- **Windows release:** Version **4.0.7 compiled**; the broader regression tests are still running. It has **not been installed yet**.\n- **MT5 integration:** One current broker-settings snapshot was captured. Independent review is checking its accuracy and an exporter launch issue.\n- **Main remaining work:** Complete the cost-aware execution/account model, run financial backtests, connect outcome-guided optimization, and verify the installed application.\n\n**No ICT strategy has yet demonstrated your required PF of 1.7â€“2.0.** The next decisive milestone is measuring these candidates after spread, fees, slippage and execution constraints. A single completion percentage would currently overstate readiness.\n\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 1012, "text_sha256": "4bd766a741220ce54e18cd60be3b02041c1b1f317fd16719c3161fa21595f635", "section": "conversation"}
