ney even before the separately charged fees**. Fees alone do not explain the failure.\n\nIâ€™m prioritizing one researched change to the trading logicâ€”adding an explicit daily liquidity direction to the entry setupâ€”and testing that hypothesis before expanding the search. In parallel, Iâ€™m finishing the corrected UI package. I cannot give you a credible deadline for profitability.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 1065, "text_sha256": "cd786b23f1b9f2114b23022e9d483db889ece0e1c9a66db8673598671b576366", "section": "conversation"}
