{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 60697, "timestamp": "2026-10-19T06:05:28.898Z", "message_id": "msg_0a2e144af6437231016ad5b324ce84819187bd6d5f9b092216", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "parts": ["The ICT module is **still unfinished, and no profitable ICT strategy has been verified**. I spent too much time on testing and reporting infrastructure while the trading core remained unresolved.\n\nWhat works: ICT navigation, original tick replay, saved trades and equity charts, and read-only Exness demo communication. Version 4.0.8 is installed.\n\nWhat failed: the latest audited training study lost money in every configuration. The best primary-cost result was **PF 0.45 over 47 trades**, well below your 1.7 minimum. This is not a successful three-month validation.\n\nWhat remains: a real UI freeze needs its tested repair installed; outcome-guided optimisation is still being implemented; the revised ICT entry mechanism needs testing. Two internal workers and the second chat are active on those separate tasks.\n\nI cannot give a defensible completion percentage or promise profitability. Iâ€™m continuing with these specific unfinished items.\n"], "text": "The ICT module is **still unfinished, and no profitable ICT strategy has been verified**. I spent too much time on testing and reporting infrastructure while the trading core remained unresolved.\n\nWhat works: ICT navigation, original tick replay, saved trades and equity charts, and read-only Exness demo communication. Version 4.0.8 is installed.\n\nWhat failed: the latest audited training study lost money in every configuration. The best primary-cost result was **PF 0.45 over 47 trades**, well below your 1.7 minimum. This is not a successful three-month validation.\n\nWhat remains: a real UI freeze needs its tested repair installed; outcome-guided optimisation is still being implemented; the revised ICT entry mechanism needs testing. Two internal workers and the second chat are active on those separate tasks.\n\nI cannot give a defensible completion percentage or promise profitability. Iâ€™m continuing with these specific unfinished items.\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 1079, "text_sha256": "e0ddca42d0f5ebc072b4bae6d3cb4438b24412b0e337b52ae2ab795bbf41c67f", "section": "conversation"}
