eplacement build is running. Installation and physical verification remain pending.\n- **Still developing:** outcome-guided optimisation and a revised causal ICT entry mechanism. These are not yet integrated or proven profitable.\n\nI cannot honestly give a reliable completion percentage or a date for achieving PF 1.7â€“2. The immediate priority is finishing the working engine and testing its revised logic against actual tick data.\n\n", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 1081, "text_sha256": "294861501d8e7cbd7e992eb35542f566c4e88668ba1206941b290595ecef7229", "section": "conversation"}
