{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 60954, "timestamp": "2026-10-19T06:13:36.027Z", "message_id": "msg_0a2e144af6437231016ad5b50c5d7081918e1207c6c08c71b6", "role": "assistant", "phase": "final_answer", "parts": ["**Yesâ€”I rechecked both roadmap files.** Weâ€™ll work through them one milestone at a time.\n\nThe six planned foundations are:\n\n1. **Structure and liquidity:** existing SMC and ICT.\n2. **Trend and momentum:** EMA, trend and pullbacks.\n3. **Auction and value:** volume profile and VWAP.\n4. **Volatility expansion:** compression and breakouts.\n5. **Statistical mean reversion.**\n6. **Order flow and microstructure:** where the available data supports it.\n\nThe shared work includes trustworthy data and execution simulation, training-only optimisation with later evaluation, testing two/three-foundation agreement, a six-sector dashboard, shadow/demo testing, and finally a local LLM supervisor.\n\n**The immediate task remains finishing ICT and verifying its engine and UI.** The later foundations and LLM remain future stages; they have not been completed."], "text": "**Yesâ€”I rechecked both roadmap files.** Weâ€™ll work through them one milestone at a time.\n\nThe six planned foundations are:\n\n1. **Structure and liquidity:** existing SMC and ICT.\n2. **Trend and momentum:** EMA, trend and pullbacks.\n3. **Auction and value:** volume profile and VWAP.\n4. **Volatility expansion:** compression and breakouts.\n5. **Statistical mean reversion.**\n6. **Order flow and microstructure:** where the available data supports it.\n\nThe shared work includes trustworthy data and execution simulation, training-only optimisation with later evaluation, testing two/three-foundation agreement, a six-sector dashboard, shadow/demo testing, and finally a local LLM supervisor.\n\n**The immediate task remains finishing ICT and verifying its engine and UI.** The later foundations and LLM remain future stages; they have not been completed.", "images": [], "source_kind": "visible_chat_event", "index": 1090, "text_sha256": "514245ac128db5dd25e8670259feff9fa652151090b89a5284a5534c970d6e4f", "section": "conversation"}
