{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 8127, "timestamp": "2026-10-15T21:42:15.920Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad148b1b5548191be27cfc62751880c", "role": "assistant", "phase": "final_answer", "parts": ["The cost audit is implemented using **42.76 million original 2026 Exness demo ticks**.\n\n- Gold spread: median **$0.260/oz**, 95th percentile **$0.360**, maximum **$2.000**.\n- Larger adverse execution buffers reduced the candidateâ€™s PF to **1.003** and **0.846**. Both failed stronger cost stress.\n- Fee assumptions and quote-movement estimates are now clearly separated from measured live fills.\n\n**No strategy qualifies for deployment.** Gold/Silver research has started, with 24 prototype checks passing; profitability remains untested.\n\n[Download MarketLink 3.3 installer](</C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Downloads/MarketLink-3.3.0-Setup.exe>) Â· [Detailed cost audit](</C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Desktop/codex/mt5-desktop-bridge/docs/EXECUTION-COST-AUDIT-2026.md>)\n\nThe app update passed **444 checks** and visual inspection. Close your existing MarketLink window before installing. Source and verified packages are saved in your [private GitHub release](https://github.com/EhosanurRahmanRomi/marketlink-mt5-bridge/releases/tag/v3.3.0).\n\n<oai-mem-citation>\n<citation_entries>\nMEMORY.md:179-189|note=[retained PF2 and native execution evidence requirements]\n</citation_entries>\n<rollout_ids>\n01a0dd88-38fa-7712-8056-cd0d27684bf4\n</rollout_ids>\n</oai-mem-citation>"], "text": "The cost audit is implemented using **42.76 million original 2026 Exness demo ticks**.\n\n- Gold spread: median **$0.260/oz**, 95th percentile **$0.360**, maximum **$2.000**.\n- Larger adverse execution buffers reduced the candidateâ€™s PF to **1.003** and **0.846**. Both failed stronger cost stress.\n- Fee assumptions and quote-movement estimates are now clearly separated from measured live fills.\n\n**No strategy qualifies for deployment.** Gold/Silver research has started, with 24 prototype checks passing; profitability remains untested.\n\n[Download MarketLink 3.3 installer](</C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Downloads/MarketLink-3.3.0-Setup.exe>) Â· [Detailed cost audit](</C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Desktop/codex/mt5-desktop-bridge/docs/EXECUTION-COST-AUDIT-2026.md>)\n\nThe app update passed **444 checks** and visual inspection. Close your existing MarketLink window before installing. Source and verified packages are saved in your [private GitHub release](https://github.com/EhosanurRahmanRomi/marketlink-mt5-bridge/releases/tag/v3.3.0).\n\n<oai-mem-citation>\n<citation_entries>\nMEMORY.md:179-189|note=[retained PF2 and native execution evidence requirements]\n</citation_entries>\n<rollout_ids>\n01a0dd88-38fa-7712-8056-cd0d27684bf4\n</rollout_ids>\n</oai-mem-citation>", "images": [], "source_kind": "original_assistant_output", "index": 14, "text_sha256": "63a18fcf9f1bcef35bc0d1c94bfc4e7da6893329946413d846068b189b450630", "section": "original_answer_variant"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 10692, "timestamp": "2026-10-15T23:31:16.321Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad1623e9ae08191b5782b1ac0a690ee", "role": "assistant", "phase": "final_answer", "parts": ["Implemented the first self-learning research engine in **MarketLink 3.4**. It learns from closed simulated trades, updates weights, records mistakes, and replays its take/skip decisions separately.\n\n[Download Windows installer](<C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Downloads/MarketLink-3.4.0-Setup.exe>) Â· [Private GitHub release](https://github.com/EhosanurRahmanRomi/marketlink-mt5-bridge/releases/tag/v3.4.0)\n\nClose the existing MarketLink before installing. Then open **Local AI â†’ Self-learning engine**.\n\n**Verification:** 866 implementation checks and 46 pilot checks passed; all six new screens were visually inspected.\n\n**Actual result:** on 3.67 million 2026 quotes, PF changed from **1.1121 to 1.1113**. The model learned, but profitability did not improve. Fees/slippage remain assumptions; live adaptation is disabled.\n\n[Research sources and usage guide](<C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Desktop/codex/mt5-desktop-bridge/docs/SMC-SELF-LEARNING.md>)\n\n<oai-mem-citation>\n<citation_entries>\nMEMORY.md:179-189|note=[retained native cost and profitability evidence requirements]\n</citation_entries>\n<rollout_ids>\n01a0dd88-38fa-7712-8056-cd0d27684bf4\n</rollout_ids>\n</oai-mem-citation>"], "text": "Implemented the first self-learning research engine in **MarketLink 3.4**. It learns from closed simulated trades, updates weights, records mistakes, and replays its take/skip decisions separately.\n\n[Download Windows installer](<C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Downloads/MarketLink-3.4.0-Setup.exe>) Â· [Private GitHub release](https://github.com/EhosanurRahmanRomi/marketlink-mt5-bridge/releases/tag/v3.4.0)\n\nClose the existing MarketLink before installing. Then open **Local AI â†’ Self-learning engine**.\n\n**Verification:** 866 implementation checks and 46 pilot checks passed; all six new screens were visually inspected.\n\n**Actual result:** on 3.67 million 2026 quotes, PF changed from **1.1121 to 1.1113**. The model learned, but profitability did not improve. Fees/slippage remain assumptions; live adaptation is disabled.\n\n[Research sources and usage guide](<C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Desktop/codex/mt5-desktop-bridge/docs/SMC-SELF-LEARNING.md>)\n\n<oai-mem-citation>\n<citation_entries>\nMEMORY.md:179-189|note=[retained native cost and profitability evidence requirements]\n</citation_entries>\n<rollout_ids>\n01a0dd88-38fa-7712-8056-cd0d27684bf4\n</rollout_ids>\n</oai-mem-citation>", "images": [], "source_kind": "original_assistant_output", "index": 15, "text_sha256": "9852d20b03391c29f34e67df69d43d30b3f547edf4c48d73fdcf0776153f5247", "section": "original_answer_variant"}
{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 11961, "timestamp": "2026-10-16T01:05:56.007Z", "message_id": "msg_0c38f0064b42ade4016ad1786f97108191b8996facc812414d", "role": "assistant", "phase": "final_answer", "parts": ["The SMC self-learning layer is implemented. It records predictions, learns from closed simulated trades and preserves model history. Open **Local AI â†’ Self-learning engine** in MarketLink.\n\n**Profitable improvement is still unproven:** the latest test used 42.76 million Exness Gold ticks; all 12 learner variants failed the qualification gates. No strategy was activated.\n\nI also verified a separate EURUSD tick sample and pushed the reviewed changes to [your GitHub repository](https://github.com/EhosanurRahmanRomi/marketlink-mt5-bridge), commit `87ce4e9`.\n\n[Read the complete test results](</C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Desktop/codex/mt5-desktop-bridge/docs/SMC-EXPECTANCY-RESULTS-2026.md>). Research remains active.\n\n<oai-mem-citation>\n<citation_entries>\nMEMORY.md:185-188|note=[kept implementation parity separate from native profitability proof]\n</citation_entries>\n<rollout_ids>\n01a0dd88-38fa-7712-8056-cd0d27684bf4\n</rollout_ids>\n</oai-mem-citation>"], "text": "The SMC self-learning layer is implemented. It records predictions, learns from closed simulated trades and preserves model history. Open **Local AI â†’ Self-learning engine** in MarketLink.\n\n**Profitable improvement is still unproven:** the latest test used 42.76 million Exness Gold ticks; all 12 learner variants failed the qualification gates. No strategy was activated.\n\nI also verified a separate EURUSD tick sample and pushed the reviewed changes to [your GitHub repository](https://github.com/EhosanurRahmanRomi/marketlink-mt5-bridge), commit `87ce4e9`.\n\n[Read the complete test results](</C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Desktop/codex/mt5-desktop-bridge/docs/SMC-EXPECTANCY-RESULTS-2026.md>). Research remains active.\n\n<oai-mem-citation>\n<citation_entries>\nMEMORY.md:185-188|note=[kept implementation parity separate from native profitability proof]\n</citation_entries>\n<rollout_ids>\n01a0dd88-38fa-7712-8056-cd0d27684bf4\n</rollout_ids>\n</oai-mem-citation>", "images": [], "source_kind": "original_assistant_output", "index": 16, "text_sha256": "31d6e29366547feb6b92b0e6475fc756ae71edb9ce67e7224ae974f676d84762", "section": "original_answer_variant"}
