{"file": "rollout-2026-10-15T13-43-10-01a13e83-da25-79c2-8413-bcf2766efa8a.jsonl", "line": 53661, "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:22:46.271Z", "message_id": "msg_0f828a1fe0455d72016ad5005e49448191a66b48b2516ed28f", "role": "assistant", "phase": "final_answer", "parts": ["**The app foundation is working, but ICT is not yet ready for deployment.**\n\n- **Installed app:** MarketLink 4.0.6 is open and responding. The completed backtestâ€™s chart, trades and result screens were inspected.\n- **Three-month test completed:** Processed **18.94 million Exness tick records**, using actual Bid/Ask spread plus modeled commission and slippage. The old preset produced **2 losing trades, PF 0**â€”it failed.\n- **Replacement ICT core implemented:** Liquidity sweep â†’ structure break â†’ overlapping breaker/FVG â†’ retracement entry, with session timing and volatility filters.\n- **Latest core tests:** **43 checks passed across 8 groups using invented quote sequences.** These verify behavior, not profitability. Separate component reviews found an ATR issue, which was fixed and retested.\n- **Parallel chat:** Actively reviewing the complete replacement engine independently.\n\n**Still pending:** original-tick testing of the replacement, realistic account replay, outcome-guided optimization with Stop/best-result preservation, and final UI integration and packaging.\n\n**No strategy currently meets your PF 1.7 minimum.** An overall completion percentage would conceal these substantial unfinished parts.\n\n[Read the verified three-month result](</C:/Users/EHOSANUR RAHMAN ROMI/Desktop/codex/mt5-desktop-bridge/docs/ICT-ORIGINAL-90DAY-RESULT-2026-10-18.md>).\n\n<oai-mem-citation>\n<citation_entries>\nMEMORY.md:30-30|note=[preserved local broker data boundaries]\n</citation_entries>\n<rollout_ids>\n01a13190-04da-7773-af76-0aa89a528609\n</rollout_ids>\n</oai-mem-citation>"], "text": "**The app foundation is working, but ICT is not yet ready for deployment.**\n\n- **Installed app:** MarketLink 4